{
    "name": "WhatsApp Bot (OpenWA) - Combined: Ingestion + Handler + Logger",
    "nodes": [
        {
            "parameters": {
                "content": "## Assumptions to verify before running\n\n**CSV columns assumed:**\n- customer_qnas.csv: Category, Question, Answer, Reference_URL\n- product_info.csv: product_name, category, description, price, sku, availability\n- order_data.csv: phone_number, order_id, product_name, quantity, order_status, order_date\n\nAdjust the 'Format Rows as Chunks', 'Upsert Orders Table', and 'Build Customer Context' nodes if your real headers differ.\n\n**Postgres tables expected (create via init-db if missing):**\n- kb_embeddings(id, content text, metadata jsonb, embedding vector(1536))\n- orders(phone_number text, order_id text, product_name text, quantity int, order_status text, order_date date, updated_at timestamptz default now(), PRIMARY KEY(phone_number, order_id))\n- conversations(id serial, chat_id text, from_number text, session_id text, user_message text, bot_reply text, created_at timestamptz default now())\n\n**Credentials needed:** OpenAI, Postgres (isolated openwa_user), OpenWA API Key (HTTP Header Auth: X-API-Key)\n\n**File paths assumed:** /data/kb/customer_qnas.csv, /data/kb/product_info.csv, /data/kb/order_data.csv (adjust to your mounted volume path)",
                "height": 420,
                "width": 480
            },
